---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Case Studies | Pikes Peak Web Designs"
description: "Real builds, real outcomes. Case studies for sites I have shipped, written in plain language and verifiable in public auditors."
permalink: /case-studies/
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Case studies</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="section-label">Case studies</span>
    <h1>Real builds, <em>verifiable numbers.</em></h1>
    <p>Every case study is a real site, with the architecture decisions named, the metrics published, and the auditors anyone can run themselves. Client studies populate as written permission lands; the agency's own site is published as the methodology in practice.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:1080px">

    <div class="case-study-grid">
      {% for cs in caseStudies %}
        <a href="/case-studies/{{ cs.slug }}/" class="case-study-card{% if cs.selfStudy %} case-study-card--self{% endif %}{% if cs.screenshot %} case-study-card--shot{% endif %}">
          {% if cs.screenshot %}
          <div class="case-study-card-shot">
            <img src="{{ cs.screenshot }}" alt="{{ cs.client }} home page screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="800">
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="case-study-card-body">
            <div class="case-study-card-eyebrow">
              {% if cs.selfStudy and not cs.screenshot %}<span class="case-study-card-pill">Dogfood &middot; the agency's own site</span>{% endif %}
              {% if cs.selfStudy and cs.screenshot %}<span class="case-study-card-pill">Self-built</span>{% endif %}
              <span>{{ cs.trade }}{% if cs.metro %} &middot; {{ cs.metro }}{% endif %}</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="case-study-card-title">{{ cs.client }}</h2>
            <p class="case-study-card-summary">{{ cs.summary }}</p>
            <div class="case-study-card-metrics">
              {% for m in cs.metrics %}
                {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
                <div class="case-study-card-metric">
                  <span class="case-study-card-metric-label">{{ m.label }}</span>
                  <strong class="case-study-card-metric-value">{{ m.value or m.after }}</strong>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <span class="case-study-card-cta">Read the case study &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <aside class="case-study-fallback">
      <span class="section-label">More to come</span>
      <p>Each new study lands here as a paying client signs the publish-consent clause in the <a href="/agreement/" class="inline-link">service agreement</a>. Until then, here is the rest of the public proof you can audit yourself today:</p>
      <ul style="margin:1.25rem 0 0;line-height:1.9">
        <li><a href="/samples/" class="inline-link">Six demo sites</a>, six trades, six visual languages, every page custom-coded. Test any one in <a href="https://pagespeed.web.dev" rel="noopener" class="inline-link">PageSpeed Insights</a>.</li>
        <li><a href="/technical-approach/" class="inline-link">Technical approach</a>, the stack, the targets, and the measurements every site is held to.</li>
        <li><a href="/changelog/" class="inline-link">Public changelog</a>, the ship cadence on this site, in the shape a real client release log takes.</li>
        <li><a href="/owners-guide/" class="inline-link">Owner's Guide</a>, what every client receives on launch day, in plain language.</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <span class="section-label">Want your build to be the next case study?</span>
    <h2>Twenty minutes is plenty.</h2>
    <p>Book a discovery call. If we are a fit, your site is the next one written up here, with your written permission and your real numbers.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Book a discovery call</a>
      <a href="/samples/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">See sample websites</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
